.superpowers/
.DS_Store
node_modules/
*.log
host/config.json
# saveConfig() writes this beside it on every settings change, and it holds the
# same wifi token. The repo is public; one `git add -A` is all it would take.
host/config.json.bak
# Any other sidecar of the config too -- it carries the pairing token and the
# repo is public, so an exact-path rule is one careless backup name away from
# committing it. Widened 2026-07-30 after a .presync-places copy landed outside
# the rules.
host/config.json.*
*.bin
start-buddy.vbs
*.bsp
firmware/main/wifi_creds.h
host/seed/sprites/
host/seed/oak.png
# Real Game Boy cries, baked by scripts/bake-cries.mjs. Nintendo audio, same
# rule and same reason as the sprites above: this fork is public. A fresh
# checkout runs the baker once, exactly as it runs bake-assets.mjs.
host/seed/cries/
